statement:
Let P, Q, n ∈ ℕ, U ⊆ ℝ^P, V ⊆ ℝ^Q, X ∈ D_n(U), S ∈ D_n(V), and let f : ℝ^P → ℝ^Q be differentiable at every point. Suppose IsLipschitzPushforward X f S holds, i.e. there are M, θ, ξ, L : ℝ^P → (ℝ^P →L ℝ^Q) such that:
- IsRectifiableTriple U n M θ ξ;
- X(ψ) = τ(M, θ, ξ)(ψ) for all ψ ∈ Dⁿ(U);
- for Hⁿ⌞M-a.e. x, every weighted approximate tangent space T_x of (M, θ) at x and every v ∈ T_x, the map t ↦ f(x + tv) has derivative L(x)v at t = 0;
- S(ω) = ∫_M θ(x)·(L(x)_#ξ(x))(ω(f(x))) dHⁿ(x) for all ω ∈ Dⁿ(V).
Then S(ω) = X(η) for all ω ∈ Dⁿ(V) and η ∈ Dⁿ(U) for which there is an open set N ⊇ spt X with η(x) = Df(x)^#ω(f(x)) := ω(f(x)).compContinuousLinearMap (Df(x)) for every x ∈ N.
